<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on Bobls 119 and 117.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on Bobls 119 and 117.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said it has issued 60 million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the 5.0 percent Bobl series 119 and the 5.125 percent Bobl series 117.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   28.OCT.96	LISTING   FFRT, DUSS</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100		ONE WARRANT CONTROLS 100 DEM</p>
<p>+ + + + + +</p>
<p> WARRANT	EXPIRY     STRIKE    ISSUE    PREMIUM  GEARING</p>
<p> 119 CALL     15.SEP.97  102 PCT   0.43 DEM 1.20 PCT 235.40 X</p>
<p> 119 PUT	15.SEP.97  100 PCT   1.65 DEM 0.42 PCT 61.35 X</p>
<p> 119 PUT	15.SEP.97  101 PCT   2.28 DEM 2.47 PCT 44.39 X</p>
<p> 117 CALL     14.MAR.97  101 PCT   1.08 DEM 0.09 PCT 94.44 X</p>
<p> 117 CALL     14.MAR.97  102 PCT   0.52 DEM 0.52 PCT 196.13 X</p>
<p> 117 PUT	14.MAR.97  101 PCT   0.74 DEM 1.61 PCT 137.70 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
